OL,3,ABarristers must stop using rape myths
OL,4,Ain trials, justice secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe justice secretary has called for
OL,7,Fnew rules to prevent barristers from
OL,8,Fusing rape myths to defend their
OL,9,Fclients in the wake of the Russell
OL,10,FBrand trial.
OL,12,FAs first reported by the Times, in a
OL,13,Fletter to the Bar Standards Board
OL,14,F(BSB), Alex Norris said it was
OL,15,F"unacceptable" to "perpetuate myths"
OL,16,Fabout victims in court and disciplinary
OL,17,Faction could be taken against those who
OL,18,Fdo so.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
