OL,3,AYemeni forces retreat to defend port
OL,4,Acity from Houthis
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouthi-run media say the movement has
OL,7,Ftaken control of the evacuated
OL,8,Fterritory. Saudi Arabia has not
OL,9,Fcommented.
OL,11,FThe shift ends a weeks-long offensive
OL,12,Fto try to secure the area near the key
OL,13,Fshipping route which the Houthis seized
OL,14,Fin a surprise offensive in September.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
